BREAKING: Three-star athlete Kaiden James @Ka1den__  has announced his commitment to the Troy Trojans, giving Troy another explosive playmaker in its 2027 recruiting class. The 6-foot-2, 180-pound standout from Callaway High School (Hogansville, Ga.) is ranked as a 3⭐️ prospect and brings the size, speed, and versatility to make an impact on either side of the ball. James is rated No. 781 nationally, No. 101 wide receiver, and No. 88 player in Georgia by Rivals. With his athleticism and big-play ability, the talented 2027 prospect has the potential to become a major weapon for the Trojans as the program continues to build momentum on the recruiting trail.
