I spent the weekend in Georgia with @TE_Steiner playing 18U competition at Scenic City T25. There’s no sugar coating it…I was not my best this weekend…way too many free passes and that’s not like me. Pitching to lineups full of older D1 commits with a tight zone was a challenge. I finished strong for a combined 4-2 win against Wisconsin Lightning 2027 with @Shaye_Tepley in our last game of the weekend. It was a great experience and I learned a lot about the things I can improve on. Thank you @OilerPride22 for inviting me to play with your talented team. 💙🖤 Thank you to the coaches who took the time to watch us play. Back to work! 💪🏻 
